{"seq":2,"slug":"affected-batch-buyer-reach","title":"批次/序列号定位与买家反查（联120）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-execution/affected-batch-buyer-reach","wordCount":1731,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"批次-序列号定位与买家反查-联120\">批次/序列号定位与买家反查（联120）</h1><p>召回令签下来之后，第一个技术问题往往是：这批货卖给了谁。如果商品标识只到品类级，答案就是&quot;所有人&quot;——全量下架、全量通知，成本按型号全生命周期计算。如果标识到批次级或单品级，答案才可能是&quot;这 12,000 件里的 3,400 件，发往这 7 个仓库，对应这 5,200 个订单&quot;。这一篇讲的就是这条反查链路的构建。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-正向追溯与反向追溯\">核心概念：正向追溯与反向追溯</h2><p>召回本质上是一次图遍历。正向追溯从一批生产出发，找到它流向的仓库、订单、买家；反向追溯从一件受伤消费者的商品出发，找到它与哪些商品同批、同批货又流向哪里。两条方向共用同一张追溯图谱，只是起点不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[批次 LOT-SZX2609L02] --&gt; B[工厂出货单]&#10;  B --&gt; C[集装箱/托盘 PLT-...]&#10;  C --&gt; D[目的仓入库单]&#10;  D --&gt; E[上架库存批次绑定]&#10;  E --&gt; F[出库拣货记录]&#10;  F --&gt; G[订单号]&#10;  G --&gt; H[买家账号 + 收货信息]&#10;  H --&gt; I[触达渠道: 邮件/PUSH/短信]&#10;  E --&gt; J[未售库存]&#10;  J --&gt; K[就地锁定/退回]&#10;  G --&gt; L[物流单号]&#10;  L --&gt; M[承运商轨迹: 判断是否已妥投]\">graph TD\n  A[批次 LOT-SZX2609L02] --&gt; B[工厂出货单]\n  B --&gt; C[集装箱/托盘 PLT-...]\n  C --&gt; D[目的仓入库单]\n  D --&gt; E[上架库存批次绑定]\n  E --&gt; F[出库拣货记录]\n  F --&gt; G[订单号]\n  G --&gt; H[买家账号 + 收货信息]\n  H --&gt; I[触达渠道: 邮件/PUSH/短信]\n  E --&gt; J[未售库存]\n  J --&gt; K[就地锁定/退回]\n  G --&gt; L[物流单号]\n  L --&gt; M[承运商轨迹: 判断是否已妥投]</pre><p>这张图里有两个经常缺失的环。一是 D 到 E：很多仓库入库时只登记 SKU 与数量，不登记批次，导致批次信息在入库环节就断了；二是 G 到 H 之外还应有 G 到 L 的路径——如果订单还在运输途中，最优处理是拦截，而不是通知买家收货后再退回。两个缺失都发生在系统设计阶段，用事后补数据是补不回来的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"追溯数据的三个关键绑定\">追溯数据的三个关键绑定</h2><p>反查能不能做，取决于三处绑定是否完整。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>绑定</th>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>缺失后果</th>\n<th>补救难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批次 → 库存</td>\n<td>仓库入库环节</td>\n<td>无法区分同 SKU 不同批次</td>\n<td>极难事后补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存 → 订单</td>\n<td>出库拣货环节</td>\n<td>无法把批次映射到买家</td>\n<td>极难事后补</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单 → 触达地址</td>\n<td>订单与账号体系</td>\n<td>定位到了买家但联系不上</td>\n<td>中等，可多渠道兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前两处一旦缺失，就只能退化为全型号召回。因此它们必须在系统上线时就是强制的：入库不录批次则不允许上架可售，出库不记批次则不允许发货。用&quot;阻断&quot;而不是&quot;提醒&quot;来保证数据质量，是这类合规数据唯一可靠的落地方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"追溯事件表的结构\">追溯事件表的结构</h3><p>用事件流而不是状态快照记录流转，能同时支持正向与反向遍历，并天然保留审计记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table trace_event (&#10;  id            bigserial primary key,&#10;  event_type    text not null check (event_type in&#10;                  (&#39;produce&#39;,&#39;aggregate&#39;,&#39;ship&#39;,&#39;receive&#39;,&#39;putaway&#39;,&#39;pick&#39;,&#39;deliver&#39;)),&#10;  occurred_at   timestamptz not null,&#10;  location_id   text,&#10;  parent_id     text,          -- 托盘/箱&#10;  child_ids     text[],        -- 单品/箱&#10;  gtin          text,&#10;  lot           text,&#10;  serial        text,&#10;  order_id      text,&#10;  source_doc    text,&#10;  recorded_at   timestamptz not null default now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;create index on trace_event (gtin, lot, occurred_at);&#10;create index on trace_event (order_id);&#10;create index on trace_event using gin (child_ids);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> trace_event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  event_type    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (event_type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'produce'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'aggregate'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ship'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'receive'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'putaway'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pick'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'deliver'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  occurred_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  location_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 托盘/箱</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  child_ids     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 单品/箱</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  gtin          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  serial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_doc    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recorded_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_event (gtin, lot, occurred_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_event (order_id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> index</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_event </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">using</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gin (child_ids);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>order_id</code> 允许为空，因为生产与入库事件没有订单。把订单号放在事件上而不是单独建映射表，是为了让&quot;库存→订单&quot;这条边在事件流里天然存在，反查时不必跨表拼接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反查查询-从批次到买家\">反查查询：从批次到买家</h2><p>召回发起时最常用的两个查询：给定批次，列出待拦截的未售库存；给定批次，列出已发货订单。下面用窗口函数解决一个实际问题——同一订单可能拣了多个批次，需要标记部分受影响订单，以便区别处理。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 已发货订单：批次影响面 + 是否部分命中&#10;with hits as (&#10;  select e.order_id, e.lot, e.gtin,&#10;         count(*) filter (where e.lot = $1) as hit_lines,&#10;         count(*)                            as total_lines,&#10;         min(e.occurred_at)                  as shipped_at&#10;  from trace_event e&#10;  where e.event_type = &#39;pick&#39;&#10;    and e.lot in (select lot from recall_target_lot where recall_decision_id = $2)&#10;  group by e.order_id, e.lot, e.gtin&#10;)&#10;select h.order_id,&#10;       h.hit_lines,&#10;       h.total_lines,&#10;       case when h.hit_lines = h.total_lines then &#39;full&#39; else &#39;partial&#39; end as impact,&#10;       h.shipped_at,&#10;       o.contact_email,&#10;       s.tracking_status&#10;from hits h&#10;join orders o on o.order_id = h.order_id&#10;left join shipment s on s.order_id = h.order_id&#10;order by impact, h.shipped_at desc;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 已发货订单：批次影响面 + 是否部分命中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hit_lines,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_lines,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">occurred_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipped_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trace_event e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">event_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pick'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lot</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_target_lot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recall_decision_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  group by</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hit_lines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_lines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       case</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> when</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">hit_lines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">total_lines</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> then</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'full'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'partial'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> impact,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipped_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">contact_email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tracking_status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hits h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">on</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">left join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">on</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">order by</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> impact, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipped_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>impact</code> 字段区分全命中与部分命中，对补救方案影响很大：全命中订单可以整体退款，部分命中则需与买家协商只退回受影响件。不分区的粗略处理通常会导致多退、错退，进而抬高召回成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"未售库存的锁定\">未售库存的锁定</h3><p>同时要有一张&quot;锁定&quot;动作表，把已定位的库存从可售状态摘出。锁定必须是可审计的动作记录，而不是直接改库存数量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"create table recall_hold (&#10;  id            bigserial primary key,&#10;  recall_decision_id bigint not null,&#10;  lot           text   not null,&#10;  location_id   text   not null,&#10;  qty_on_hold   int    not null,&#10;  hold_reason   text   not null default &#39;recall&#39;,&#10;  held_at       timestamptz not null default now(),&#10;  released_at   timestamptz,&#10;  disposition   text   check (disposition in (&#39;destroy&#39;,&#39;rework&#39;,&#39;return_to_supplier&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> table</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> recall_hold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigserial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> primary key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  recall_decision_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  lot           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  location_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty_on_hold   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    not null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hold_reason   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'recall'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  held_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  released_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  disposition   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   check</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (disposition </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'destroy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rework'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'return_to_supplier'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>用独立表记录锁定而不是改库存主表，一是保留了&quot;何时锁了多少&quot;的审计链，二是避免锁定动作被后续的库存同步任务覆盖。<code>disposition</code> 字段对应召回终局的处置方式，通常在监管批准后填写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反查精度与成本的权衡\">反查精度与成本的权衡</h2><p>批次级与单品级追溯的成本差异很大，选择要基于风险而非一律上高精度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>标识成本</th>\n<th>反查精度</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仅 GTIN</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>全型号</td>\n<td>低风险品类，或仅用于趋势分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTIN + 批次</td>\n<td>中，生产喷码</td>\n<td>单批</td>\n<td>材料或工艺相关缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTIN + 序列号</td>\n<td>高，需逐件赋码与扫描</td>\n<td>单件</td>\n<td>高值或个体差异大的产品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批次 + 出库明细</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n<td>需要区分同批不同渠道时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行的&quot;逐件赋码与扫描&quot;是成本跃升点：不只是多印一个号，而是整条拣货、包装、出库流程都要增加扫描动作。因此序列号通常只用于医疗、儿童安全座椅等高风险或高值品类。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触达率是最终的交付指标\">触达率是最终的交付指标</h3><p>反查出订单列表只是中间产物，真正的交付指标是<strong>触达率</strong>与<strong>响应率</strong>。订单里的联系方式可能已失效，需要多路径兜底。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"触达级联（按顺序尝试，任一成功则停止）：&#10;  1. 订单联系邮箱        -&gt; 记录送达/退信&#10;  2. 账号主邮箱          -&gt; 覆盖更换过下单邮箱的用户&#10;  3. 账号绑定手机号      -&gt; 覆盖不常看邮件的用户&#10;  4. App/站内消息        -&gt; 覆盖活跃用户&#10;  5. 物流承运商联系信息  -&gt; 覆盖由收件人以外的人签收的场景&#10;  6. 公开通告 + 召回专页 -&gt; 覆盖二手流转与全部失败情形&#10;触达状态记录: attempted | delivered | bounced | clicked | completed\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>触达级联（按顺序尝试，任一成功则停止）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. 订单联系邮箱        -> 记录送达/退信</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. 账号主邮箱          -> 覆盖更换过下单邮箱的用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. 账号绑定手机号      -> 覆盖不常看邮件的用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. App/站内消息        -> 覆盖活跃用户</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. 物流承运商联系信息  -> 覆盖由收件人以外的人签收的场景</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  6. 公开通告 + 召回专页 -> 覆盖二手流转与全部失败情形</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>触达状态记录: attempted | delivered | bounced | clicked | completed</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后一级是必须保留的兜底，因为二手流转导致的&quot;当前持有人未知&quot;是无法通过任何订单数据解决的。这也是监管在严重风险案件中要求公开通告的实质原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与监管数据的交叉核对\">与监管数据的交叉核对</h2><p>反查结果还应与监管侧的公开通报做交叉核对，主要目的有两个：确认自己没有高估范围（避免过度召回），以及发现未申报的流通渠道（避免漏召）。如果自家反查显示某批货只发往了德国，而 Safety Gate 上同型号在法国被通报，说明流通链条中存在自己不知道的一环——通常是经销商转售或平台代发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>召回反查是一次图遍历，正向与反向共用同一张追溯图谱。</li>\n<li>三处关键绑定中，&quot;批次→库存&quot;与&quot;库存→订单&quot;缺失即无法事后补救，必须用阻断保证。</li>\n<li>用事件流记录流转，可同时支撑两个方向的遍历与审计。</li>\n<li>订单影响面需区分全命中与部分命中，否则退款会多退错退。</li>\n<li>库存锁定记录独立成表，保留审计链并避免被库存同步覆盖。</li>\n<li>序列号是成本跃升点，应按风险品类选择性使用。</li>\n<li>最终交付指标是触达率与响应率，二手持有人只能靠公开通告兜底。</li>\n<li>定位到买家后的执行动作见 <a href=\"recall-action-refund-remedy\">停售/下架/回收/维修/退款执行</a>。</li>\n<li>批次标识的编码规范与标签要求见 <a href=\"../product-safety-baseline/technical-doc-traceability-label\">技术文档、可追溯标签与合规标识</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ref.gs1.org/ai/\">GS1 Application Identifiers — ref.gs1.org</a>（AI (10) 批次/生产批用于隔离特定生产批、AI (21) 序列号用于定位单个商品）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/EPCIS\">EPCIS — Wikipedia</a>（EPCIS 2.0 事件式可见性数据标准，支持企业内与跨企业共享追溯事件）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064 — Cornell LII</a>（第 15(c) 条要求向已知交付或售出的每一个人邮寄通知）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"批次/序列号定位与买家反查（联120）","id":"批次-序列号定位与买家反查-联120"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：正向追溯与反向追溯","id":"核心概念-正向追溯与反向追溯"},{"level":2,"text":"追溯数据的三个关键绑定","id":"追溯数据的三个关键绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"追溯事件表的结构","id":"追溯事件表的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"反查查询：从批次到买家","id":"反查查询-从批次到买家"},{"level":3,"text":"未售库存的锁定","id":"未售库存的锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"反查精度与成本的权衡","id":"反查精度与成本的权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"触达率是最终的交付指标","id":"触达率是最终的交付指标"},{"level":2,"text":"与监管数据的交叉核对","id":"与监管数据的交叉核对"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"召回决策与监管沟通","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-execution/recall-decision-regulator-communication"},"next":{"title":"停售/下架/回收/维修/退款执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-safety-incident-recall-gpsr/recall-execution/recall-action-refund-remedy"}}